Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "fceed92eae294b8d99ccb110744d3f59"
}

###

# @name Refresh token with wrong parameters
POST {{BaseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "aaaa"
}

###

